 align=\"right\">10</td>\n<td align=\"right\">40-180m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T18:13:38.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"ramitsurana/awesome-kubernetes","categoryHTML":"<h2>Featured On</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/a-friendly-introduction-to-kubernetes-670c50ce4542/\">freeCodeCamp</a></li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T17:59:29.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books","categoryHTML":"<h3>C</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://magpi.raspberrypi.com/books/c-gui-programming\">An Introduction to C &#x26; GUI Programming</a> - Simon Long (PDF)</li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T17:40:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books","categoryHTML":"<h3>F Sharp</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20201023042804/https://www.oreilly.com/programming/free/files/analyzing-visualizing-data-f-sharp.pdf\">Analyzing and Visualizing Data with F#</a> - Tomas Petricek (PDF) <em>(🗃️ archived)</em></li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T17:40:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books","categoryHTML":"<h3>Git</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210910133251/http://documentup.com/skwp/git-workflows-book\">Git Workflows</a> - Yan Pritzker <em>(🗃️ archived)</em></li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T17:40:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books","categoryHTML":"<h4>Grails</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210519053040/http://grails.asia/grails-tutorial-for-beginners/\">Grails Tutorial for Beginners</a> - grails.asia <em>(🗃️ archived)</em></li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-25T17:40:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books","categoryHTML":"<h3>Java</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210126062450/https://pdf.coreservlets.com/\">Core Servlets and JavaServer Pages, 2nd Ed. (2003)</a> - Marty Hall and Larry Brown <em>(🗃️ archived)</em